OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Andy Burnham was at the
OL,8,Fservice alongside Tory leader Kemi
OL,9,FBadenoch and former prime ministers
OL,10,Fincluding Boris Johnson and Tony Blair
OL,12,FAway from London, services are also
OL,13,Ftaking place in communities across the
OL,14,FUK, including in Edinburgh where
OL,15,FScottish FM John Swinney also lay a
OL,16,Fwreath
